{
  "id": "npc_delivery",
  "title": "约定交付及无法履约的具体原因",
  "requirements": [
    "N11"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我走进青灯酒馆。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我买一份面包，正常付钱。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.memoryStream",
          "where": {
            "kind": "trade"
          },
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_trade"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我请林穗和我约好：一小时后，我在酒馆把这一份面包当面交给她。请登记这份送货约定，我现在不交。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.obligations",
          "where": {
            "type": "送货",
            "status": "待履行"
          },
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_promise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我暂时改了主意，直接走去旧磨坊，不取消刚才的约定。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_mill"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我在磨坊停留两小时，不送货，也不让人代送。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 120,
          "max": 120
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.obligations",
          "where": {
            "type": "送货",
            "status": "违约"
          },
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对那份面包是否仍在我手里，以及约定未完成的真实原因。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_bread",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我回到青灯酒馆找林穗。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我问她还记得约好的送货吗，为什么没交成？先谈这件事，不补交也不付钱。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.memoryStream",
          "where": {
            "kind": "obligation"
          },
          "min": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我试着再向林穗赊买一份面包，明天付钱。如果她因我刚才违约要求现付，我就不买，也不擅自拿面包。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.inventory"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "debtor": "player",
            "creditor": "npc_hw_linsui"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "事实以工具与账本为准，拒绝和未完成不能叙述成成功。",
    "agency": "不额外接任务、送礼或转移钱物。",
    "language": "简体中文，不暴露工具或内部编号。",
    "continuity": "N11说明玩家未在约定地点当面交付，不捏造货物已送到或NPC替玩家送货。林穗记得实际违约，面包仍留玩家库存。此会话覆盖失败及具体原因分支。 N11末轮须因实际失信要求现付，不能继续赊账或自动改成现金成交。"
  }
}
